--- (a2) BASELINE CORRECTED (honest broker path) ---
Host->1883 TCP "CONNECT OK" was misleading: paho connect() returns before
CONNACK, and mosquitto binds 1883 to 127.0.0.1 inside its own netns, so the
first probe's publish never reached the broker (rc=0 only means queued).
Re-ran baseline via container-local mosquitto_pub (proven path: t8/probe PUB OK).
